KAFA Satu Klik — OCLC (One Click Learning Centre)
Made in code with the Paper Pop-up Book style of the Lemo-Opuscar library. All characters, props and page art are original drawings in code.

Voice
- Narration: Microsoft Azure neural voice ms-MY-YasminNeural, generated through edge-tts (github.com/rany2/edge-tts, LGPL-3.0 tool).
  Synthetic voice. Check Microsoft's terms for commercial use of the voice output before running paid ads.

